BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Adult Beginner Ballet
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260601
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260602
DTSTAMP:20261110T181153Z
UID:cf5e0e692bc1d2ae6c129cad8dd4@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Adult Beginner Ballet When: Tuesdays\, September 22\, 2026 - J
 une 1\, 2027 Where: The Academy at Newport Contemporary Ballet\, 3 Charles
  Street\, Newport Our adult division welcomes adult dancers of all ages an
 d abilities. Adult classes are designed to provide a relaxed\, supportive
 \, and fun atmosphere while learning new skills and and providing a great 
 physical workout. Adult classes are filled with adults who have either dan
 ced when they were young or have always wanted to dance but never had the 
 opportunity. No dress code is required. Classes are designed to welcome ad
 ult dancers of all ages and abilities. These classes offer a fun way for d
 ancers to exercise\, meet new friends\, and enjoy movement! ($18-20/class
 \, 1 hr 15 min) (Instagram: @theacademyatncb) Adult Classes: Adults of any
  age and level are welcome to experience the joy of dance with the Academy
 ! We understand it can be nerve wracking walking into a dance studio full 
 of mirrors but not to worry\, the Academy offers a nurturing environment w
 here adult students will feel supported\, challenged\, and fulfilled. Our 
 teachers are caring\, patient and will give corrections. Adult students ne
 w to dance will enjoy our Adult Absolute Beginner class. Adults who have d
 ance experience are welcome to join Monday level 4 classes as well as any 
 Adult classes on pointe. Classes may be paid with dance cards (10 classes 
 paid in advance) or as single drop in class to accommodate your busy sched
 ule. Adults can wear comfortable clothing of their choice. We do suggest w
 earing socks or ballet slippers and pulling back long hair.\n\nSource: htt
 ps://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/adult-beginner-ballet/112082/
LOCATION:The Academy at Newport Contemporary Ballet\, 3 Charles Street\, N
 ewport\, RI 02840 Time: 7:00 PM to 8:15 PM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/adult-beginner-ballet/112082/
END:VEVENT
