BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Christmas Carol
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261105
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261106
DTSTAMP:20261110T181153Z
UID:a214778016481db972ef3f095096@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:By Charles Dickens Original Music by Richard Cumming Directed 
 by Taavon Gamble November 5 &#8211\; December 31\, 2026 Dowling Theater Ce
 lebrating 50 Years of Holiday Cheer As the clock strikes midnight on a fat
 eful Christmas Eve\, Ebenezer Scrooge gets an unexpected visit from the gh
 ost of his former partner\, Jacob Marley. In a world shaped by music\, mem
 ory\, and possibility\, Scrooge is swept into a supernatural journey throu
 gh past\, present\, and future. Along the way\, he must confront what he h
 as built\, what he has lost\, and what he still has: the power to change f
 or the good of his community\, and his very soul. This year’s 50th anniv
 ersary production\, directed by company member Taavon Gamble\, celebrates 
 the beloved legacy of Trinity Rep’s annual tradition of reimagining the 
 story anew each year.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/a-
 christmas-carol/63625/
LOCATION:Trinity Rep\, 201 Washington Street\, Providence\, RI 02903
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/a-christmas-carol/63625/
END:VEVENT
