DESCRIPTION:Join us on Tuesday\, November 10\, to celebrate our delicious 
 food truck community at The Falls Event Center with Rhody Food Trucks. Thi
 s year\, we'll focus on honoring our veterans and raising funds for charit
 y! Aquidneck Harvest Company will join us in a special speakeasy 21+ green
  room and burlesque performances. In another space on the other side of th
 is gigantic event facility\, we will also have a family-friendly room with
  an obstacle course from GYMGUYZ to keep the little ones engaged\, and a m
 arket of vendors. We'll have live music in the banquet hall\, plus delicio
 us food trucks. Don’t worry too much about the weather! This will be an 
 indoor event. And of course we’ll be presenting the awards to the trucks
  you\, dear readers\, have voted for. Make sure to vote here! Motifri.com/
 fta2026\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/food-truck-award
 s-2026/112484/
LOCATION:The Falls Events Center\, 3 Bridal Ave\, West Warwick\, 02893
