UID:448ec4f075219bf9373bb35a3117@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:This holiday season\, Centreville Bank Stadium will be transfo
 rmed into a spectacular winter wonderland as the Rhode Island Lights Festi
 val brings together dazzling light displays\, festive entertainment\, holi
 day shopping\, seasonal food and beverages\, and unforgettable experiences
  for guests of all ages. Whether you're beginning a new family tradition\,
  planning a magical date night\, gathering with friends\, or celebrating w
 ith coworkers\, the Rhode Island Lights Festival is designed to capture th
 e joy\, warmth\, and wonder of the holiday season. From strolling through 
 thousands of sparkling lights and discovering unique gifts in the Holiday 
 Market to enjoying festive treats\, meeting Santa\, and creating memories 
 that will last a lifetime\, every visit offers something special. No matte
 r how you choose to celebrate\, the Rhode Island Lights Festival has an ex
 perience designed just for you.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.co
 m/event/rhode-island-lights-festival/112530/
LOCATION:Centreville Bank Stadium\, 11 Tidewater Street\, Pawtucket\, 0268
 0 Time: 5:00 PM to 10:00 PM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/rhode-island-lights-festival/11
 2530/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Santa Magic in Long Wharf
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261128
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261129
DTSTAMP:20261110T181153Z
UID:87475b86156a7bb04dfea6f34ef6@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:🎄✨ Holiday Tree Lighting Event!✨🎄 Mark your calendar
 s! The holiday season is kicking off at the Shops of Long Wharf\, and you 
 won’t want to miss it! 🎅🎁 📅 When: Saturday\, November 28th Rain
  Date: Sunday\, November 29th ⏰ Time: 4:00 PM &#8211\; 6:00 PM 📍 Wher
 e: The Shops of Long Wharf\, Newport 💰 Cost: Free to attend Bring the w
 hole family down for an afternoon packed with festive holiday magic and co
 mpletely FREE activities: 📸 Pictures with Santa and his elves! 🎶 Fes
 tive holiday music! 🎨 Fun kid crafts right here at Cutie Curls! ✍️ 
 Letters to Santa station! 🖌️ Free face painting! A huge thank you to 
 our co-sponsors\, Cutie Curls\, Newport In Bloom and the Shops of Long Wha
 rf\, for helping us bring this holiday cheer to the community! ❤️ Gath
 er the kids\, bundle up\, and come make some wonderful holiday memories wi
 th us. We can't wait to see you all.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisla
 nd.com/event/santa-magic-in-long-wharf/112462/
LOCATION:Long Wharf Mall\, 49 Long Wharf Mall\, Newport\, RI 02840
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/santa-magic-in-long-wharf/11246
 2/
